# 🌐 API Rules

- 🔐 `GET /api/models` MUST use validated views — never return raw `getAllKnownModels()` alone.
- 🛡️ Guard chat/settings model IDs with `canSelectModel`.
- 📝 Prefer `lib/logger` over `console.error` in server middleware.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Post-Prompt Trigger**: After your prompt response is complete, ALWAYS review and update corresponding architecture documentation and tests.
